        "input": "[4,2]",
        "output": "[[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[2,3],[2,4],[3,4]]",
        "explanation": "For this input, applying the required rules of Combinations produces [[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[2,3],[2,4],[3,4]]."
